OL,7,G0705 Couples Come Dine with Me
OL,8,     FIn Portsmouth, happy-go-lucky Jim
OL,9,     Fand Justine have a crockery
OL,10,     Fdisaster. Leanne and Gary stuff
OL,11,     Ftheir starter with three packets
OL,12,     Fof blue cheese. And Stewart and
OL,13,     FLynn serve an unusual pudding.
