OL,5,G1100 Don't Tell the Bride
OL,6,     FThe Karaoke One: Military man Paul
OL,7,     Fintends to plan his wedding to his
OL,8,     Ffiancee Emily with painstaking
OL,9,     Fprecision. The karaoke reception
OL,10,     Fhe's got planned could prove
OL,11,     Fdivisive, though.
